{ "FSR3/4-FG, RDNA4 autoupgrades to FSR4-FG\n\nFSR4-FG sometimes better/worse than XeFG", "FSR3/4-FG, RDNA4 tự nâng lên FSR4-FG\n\nFSR4-FG có lúc tốt hơn, có lúc kém hơn XeFG" },
